---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Relocation Cost"
  description="What Relocation Cost collects and stores: page-view analytics, a few usage events, and calculator inputs kept only in your own browser."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Relocation Cost does not ask you to create an account and does not collect your name or contact details through the calculator.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Calculator inputs</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">The values you enter in the calculator are saved in your own browser (local storage) so they are still there when you return. They are not sent to our servers. You can clear them with the Reset button or by clearing your browser data. When you use “Share this estimate”, the values are placed in a link that you copy yourself.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">The site uses Vercel Web Analytics to count page views and a small number of events: using the calculator (with the two states selected), using the share button, and clicking the calculator links on route pages. We do not use these events to identify you. Vercel describes how its analytics works, including its approach to cookies and visitor data, in its own documentation.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Hosting and logs</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">The site is hosted by Vercel, which may keep standard technical server logs such as IP address and browser type for security and operation.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Advertising and affiliate partners</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">There are none today. If advertising or affiliate links are added, third parties may set cookies when you click or view them, and this policy and the <a class="font-semibold text-sky-700 underline" href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a> will be updated first.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Changes</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">We will update this page if what we collect changes.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
